cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Doomformer in research or writing, please cite it as below."
title: "Doomformer: integer neural networks computed by DOOM game mechanics"
type: software
version: 0.4.1
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mottopanikeiku/doomformer"
url: "https://mottopanikeiku.github.io/doomformer/"
abstract: >-
  Doomformer compiles integer neural networks (MLPs, spiking networks, transformers) into DOOM maps. Voodoo dolls do
  the arithmetic, sector light levels and plane heights hold the sums, and every value read back from ViZDoom is checked against a NumPy
  integer reference with tolerance 0.
keywords:
  - DOOM
  - ViZDoom
  - neural networks
  - transformer
  - esoteric computing
authors:
  - name: "mottopanikeiku"
